<BaseLayout title="Charters Towers"> <!-- CHANGE THIS — tab title in browser -->

  <!-- ======================================================
    HERO — the big image + text at the top of the page
  ======================================================= -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

     <div class="hero-image">
        <img
          src="https://images.kroppix.com/road/charters/charters-towers-hill.jpg"
          alt="View from Charters Towers hill"
          title="View from Charters Towers hill"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Charters Towers</h1> <!-- CHANGE THIS -->

        <!-- One or two sentences about this place/journey -->
        <p>Charters Towers sits about 135 kilometres inland from Townsville, at the edge of the dry country. 
            In the 1870s, gold was found here by a thirteen-year-old boy, 
            and within a decade the town had grown into one of the wealthiest in Queensland — 
            a full city, with its own stock exchange, banks, and the nickname it still carries: The World.</p> <!-- CHANGE THIS -->

        <p>It doesn't feel like that now. What's left is quieter — wide streets, nineteenth-century facades, 
            a gold battery still standing in the scrub. We came through on a separate trip, 
            not part of the long coastal run but out start to the inland run</p>
</div>
      
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ======================================================
